Codex CLI discovery proof — macOS arm64, Swift 6.4

Production BinaryLocator + CodexLaunchPreflight, real Node and Gatekeeper.
A throwaway local XCTest-target file called the production methods. It was
removed after the run; no installed application or account was changed.
